{
  "hash": 3239299468,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Drawing from the hip marks up to 3 enemies near the reticle. Releasing the trigger fires lock-on arrows that apply 'Sacred Flame' to each marked target for <pve [10] /> <pvp [5] /> seconds.\n\nEnemies marked by Sacred Flame explode on death, dealing <pve 295 /> <pvp [137] /> damage in a 5.5 meter radius. If a Sacred Flame explosion hits other marked enemies, they too explode.\n\nSacred Flame explosions are reduced by 50% damage at the edge of their radius.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T01:08:41.300Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
  "compendium": {
    "gid": "441434520",
    "rowKey": "Ticuu's Divination\n\nSacred Flame\nCausality Arrows\n↑Causality Quiver",
    "section": "Energy Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Solar Tracking Lightweight Bow\n\nDrawing from the hip tracks up to 3 enemies, splitting 3 arrows amongst all marked targets on release.\nEach arrow deals up to 29 [?] Damage and inflicts Sacred Flame on hit for 10 [5] seconds. \nEnemies afflicted by Sacred Flame explode upon being hit by aimed shots or upon death, dealing up to 295 [137] damage, down to 50% damage over 5.5 meters.\n\n Perfectly Drawn Precision Hits that trigger Sacred Flame explosions deal 100% increased explosion damage.\n\n↑Causality Quiver:\nSacred Flame detonations grant a stack of Causality Quiver for 5.5 seconds, up to a maximum of 6 stacks.\nCausality Quiver grants increased impact damage. Does not increase Sacred Flame detonation damage.\nInflicting Sacred Flame, detonating Sacred Flame, or damaging an enemy unaffected by Sacred Flame refreshes the Causality Quiver duration.\n\nCausality Quiver Damage Increases:\n16% | 31% | 49% | 67.5% | 87% | 87% \n3.6% | 11% | 12% | 16% | 23% | 23%",
